              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Naarai anyoun kamakus epup akirot naka Edeke, mere kotoma Makedonia ka Akaia bon, dimarai isiarakina akusiiyuun kotoma Edeke ŋiniibois kere, emamei bobo sio eipud einer akirot kere. ",
          "type": "text",
